### Public pages
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&size=20

### Public page
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/pages/about-us?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Public page by name
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/pages/name/About%20Us?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Public boxes
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/boxes?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&size=20

### Public box
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/boxes/agreement?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Public images
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/images?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Private pages
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&size=20
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Private page
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/pages/about-us?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Private boxes
