### Create box
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/box?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "code": "http-box",
  "visible": true,
  "descriptions": [{"language": "{{LANG}}", "name": "HTTP box", "description": "HTTP box body"}]
}

### Update box
PUT {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/box/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

{
  "code": "http-box",
  "visible": true,
  "descriptions": [{"language": "{{LANG}}", "name": "Updated HTTP box", "description": "Updated body"}]
}

