### Upload files
POST {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/files?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="content-image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ../../../../landing-ui/templates/basis/public/placeholder.png
--WebAppBoundary--

### Delete content
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/1?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

### Delete image
DELETE {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/private/content/?store={{STORE_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&contentType=IMAGE&name=content-image.png
Cookie: SESSION={{SESSION_ID}}

